# Page Builder V2 web client. All values are OPTIONAL: the defaults match the
# Catalyst setup, so no .env file is needed to build or deploy.
#
# NEVER put secrets here. REACT_APP_* values are compiled into the public
# JavaScript bundle at build time. API keys (Gemini, Zoho CRM, …) belong in
# the function's environment variables only.

# Path of the Catalyst function the app calls (change only if you rename it)
# REACT_APP_FUNCTION_BASE=/server/new_page_builder_v_2_function

# Where to send users who are not signed in (Catalyst hosted login)
# REACT_APP_LOGIN_URL=/__catalyst/auth/login
